OL,3,ALondon Underground lines disrupted as
OL,4,Adrivers begin 24-hour strike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe disagreement centres around the
OL,7,Fproposed voluntary introduction of a
OL,8,Ffour-day working week with condensed
OL,9,Fhours - and there are further strikes
OL,10,Fplanned in December, January and
OL,11,FFebruary
